          "_name": "pricing1",
          "_sourceTheme": "mobirise5",
          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"pricing1\" group=\"Pricing Tables\" data-bg-video=\"{{bg.type == 'video' && bg.value.url}}\" mbr-class=\"{'mbr-parallax-background': bg.parallax}\" plugins=\"mobirise-icons2\">\n\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" name=\"fullWidth\" title=\"Full Width\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"4\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"9\" step=\"1\" value=\"2\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Text\" name=\"showText\" checked>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Buttons\" name=\"showButtons\">\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"cardColor\" value=\"#eeeeee\" selected>\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <fieldset type=\"background\" name=\"bg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"image\" title=\"Image\" value=\"../_images/background1.jpg\" parallax>\n            <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" value=\"#ffffff\" selected>\n            <input type=\"video\" title=\"Video\" value=\"https://vimeo.com/428046504\">\n        </fieldset>\n        <header condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">Fallback Image</header>\n        <input type=\"image\" title=\"Fallback Image\" value=\"../_images/background13.jpg\" name=\"fallBackImage\" condition=\"bg.type === 'video'\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Overlay\" name=\"overlay\" condition=\"bg.type !== 'color'\" checked>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Overlay Color\" name=\"overlayColor\" value=\"#ffffff\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Opacity\" name=\"overlayOpacity\" min=\"0\" max=\"1\" step=\"0.1\" value=\"0.5\" condition=\"overlay && bg.type !== 'color'\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n\n    <div class=\"mbr-fallback-image disabled\" mbr-if=\"bg.type == 'video'\"></div>\n    <div class=\"mbr-overlay\" mbr-if=\"overlay && bg.type!== 'color'\" mbr-style=\"{'opacity': overlayOpacity, 'background-color': overlayColor}\">\n    </div>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h2 class=\"card-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Pros.</b><br><b>Convenient Liquid Formula:&nbsp;</b>Audifort comes in a liquid format that may be easy to incorporate into a daily wellness routine.<br><b>Multiple Ingredients:&nbsp;</b>The formula features a combination of ingredients marketed for general hearing and wellness support.<br><b>Easy to Use:&nbsp;</b>Its dropper format may appeal to people who prefer liquid supplements over traditional capsules.<br><b>Online Availability:&nbsp;</b>Consumers can explore product details and purchasing options online.<br><b>Wellness-Focused Approach:&nbsp;</b>Audifort may appeal to individuals interested in nutritional support as part of a broader wellness routine.<b><br></b></h2>\n                        <ul class=\"list mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" data-app-selector=\".list\" data-multiline mbr-article></ul>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n\n            <div class=\"card col-12 col-lg-6\">\n                <div class=\"card-wrapper\">\n                    <div class=\"card-box align-left\">\n                        <h4 class=\"card-title mb-4  mbr-fonts-style\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-5\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".card-title\">\n                            <b>Cons.</b></h4>\n                        <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style mb-5\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\" mbr-if=\"showText\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text, .link-wrap, .mbr-section-btn\"><b>Limited Clinical Evidence:&nbsp;</b>There is insufficient high-quality clinical evidence demonstrating that Audifort improves hearing or treats tinnitus.<br><b>Results May Vary:</b> Individual experiences can differ, and specific outcomes cannot be guaranteed.<br><b>Ingredient Dosage Considerations:</b> Consumers should review the product label to understand the amounts of individual ingredients.<br><b>Potential Side Effects:</b> Some ingredients may cause unwanted effects or interact with certain medications.<br><b>Not a Medical Treatment</b>: Audifort should not replace professional hearing assessments or appropriate medical care.<br>\n                        </p>\n                    </div>\n                    <div mbr-buttons mbr-theme-style=\"display-4\" class=\"mbr-section-btn\" mbr-if=\"showButtons\" data-toolbar=\"-mbrBtnMove\">\n                        <a class=\"btn btn-primary\" href=\"https://mobiri.se\" data-app-placeholder=\"Type Text\">Learn more</a>\n                    </div>\n                </div>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
