          "_customHTML": "<section data-bs-version=\"5.1\" class=\"content5\" group=\"Content\">\n    <mbr-parameters>\n        <header>Size</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Full Width\" name=\"fullWidth\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Top\" name=\"paddingTop\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"0\">\n        <input type=\"range\" inline title=\"Bottom\" name=\"paddingBottom\" min=\"0\" max=\"10\" step=\"1\" value=\"5\">\n        <input type=\"range\" name=\"textWidth\" title=\"Width\" min=\"4\" max=\"12\" value=\"10\" step=\"1\">\n        <header>Show/Hide</header>\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Title\" name=\"showTitle\">\n        <input type=\"checkbox\" title=\"Subtitle\" name=\"showSubtitle\">\n        <header>Background</header>\n        <input type=\"color\" title=\"Color\" name=\"bgColor\" value=\"#ffffff\">\n    </mbr-parameters>\n    <div mbr-class=\"{'container': !fullWidth, 'container-fluid': fullWidth}\">\n        <div class=\"row justify-content-center\">\n            <div class=\"col-md-12 col-lg-{{textWidth}}\">\n                <h3 class=\"mbr-section-title mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showTitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-title\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\">\n                    <b>Article Title</b>\n                </h3>\n                <h4 class=\"mbr-section-subtitle mbr-fonts-style mb-4\" mbr-if=\"showSubtitle\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-section-subtitle\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-2\"></h4>\n                <p class=\"mbr-text mbr-fonts-style\" data-app-selector=\".mbr-text\" mbr-theme-style=\"display-7\"><br>Terms and Conditions for Audifort\n<br>Welcome to Audifort™ website. These Terms and Conditions (\"Terms\") govern your use of this website. By accessing or using this website, you agree to comply with these Terms. If you do not agree, please discontinue using this website.\n<br>\n<br>1. Acceptance of Terms\n<br>\n<br>By using this website, you confirm that you are at least 18 years of age or have permission from a parent or legal guardian to use this website.\n<br>\n<br>Your continued use of the website constitutes acceptance of these Terms and Conditions.\n<br>\n<br>2. Website Content\n<br>\n<br>The content provided on this website is for informational and educational purposes only.\n<br>\n<br>While we make reasonable efforts to keep the information accurate and up to date, we do not guarantee the accuracy, completeness, reliability, or availability of any information presented.\n<br>\n<br>Content may be updated or modified without prior notice.\n<br>\n<br>3. Intellectual Property\n<br>\n<br>Unless otherwise stated, all content on this website—including text, graphics, images, logos, icons, design elements, and other materials—is protected by applicable copyright and intellectual property laws.\n<br>\n<br>You may not copy, reproduce, distribute, modify, republish, or exploit any content from this website without prior written permission.\n<br>\n<br>4. Product Information\n<br>\n<br>This website may contain reviews, educational content, or promotional information regarding Audifort™ and related products.\n<br>\n<br>We do not manufacture or own the products featured unless explicitly stated.\n<br>\n<br>Product descriptions, pricing, availability, bonuses, and guarantees are subject to change by the product owner without notice.\n<br>\n<br>5. Affiliate Disclosure\n<br>\n<br>This website may contain affiliate links.\n<br>\n<br>If you purchase a product through one of these links, we may earn a commission at no additional cost to you.\n<br>\n<br>Our participation in affiliate programs does not influence our editorial opinions, and we strive to provide honest, informative content.\n<br>\n<br>6. No Medical Advice\n<br>\n<br>The information on this website is not intended to diagnose, treat, cure, or prevent any disease.\n<br>\n<br>Nothing on this website should be interpreted as medical advice.\n<br>\n<br>Always consult a qualified healthcare professional before beginning any wellness program or making decisions related to your health.\n<br>\n<br>7. User Responsibilities\n<br>\n<br>By using this website, you agree that you will not:\n<br>\n<br>Violate any applicable laws or regulations.\n<br>Attempt to gain unauthorized access to the website or its systems.\n<br>Upload or distribute harmful software, viruses, or malicious code.\n<br>Use the website for fraudulent or unlawful purposes.\n<br>Interfere with the operation or security of the website.\n<br>8. Third-Party Websites\n<br>\n<br>Our website may contain links to third-party websites for your convenience.\n<br>\n<br>We are not responsible for the content, privacy policies, services, or practices of any external websites.\n<br>\n<br>Accessing third-party websites is at your own risk.\n<br>\n<br>9. Disclaimer of Warranties\n<br>\n<br>This website is provided on an \"as is\" and \"as available\" basis.\n<br>\n<br>We make no warranties or representations regarding:\n<br>\n<br>Website availability\n<br>Accuracy of information\n<br>Product performance\n<br>Uninterrupted access\n<br>Freedom from errors or viruses\n<br>\n<br>Use of this website is entirely at your own risk.\n<br>\n<br>10. Limitation of Liability\n<br>\n<br>To the fullest extent permitted by law, the owners, authors, affiliates, and operators of this website shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising from:\n<br>\n<br>Use of this website\n<br>Reliance on website content\n<br>Purchase or use of any featured product\n<br>Technical errors or website interruptions\n<br>11. Indemnification\n<br>\n<br>You agree to indemnify and hold harmless the owners, affiliates, employees, and contributors of this website from any claims, liabilities, damages, losses, or expenses arising from your misuse of the website or violation of these Terms.\n<br>\n<br>12. Privacy\n<br>\n<br>Your use of this website is also governed by our Privacy Policy, which explains how we collect, use, and protect your personal information.\n<br>\n<br>13. Changes to These Terms\n<br>\n<br>We reserve the right to modify or update these Terms and Conditions at any time without prior notice.\n<br>\n<br>Any changes will become effective immediately upon being posted on this page.\n<br>\n<br>Your continued use of the website after changes are posted constitutes acceptance of the revised Terms.\n<br>\n<br>14. Governing Law\n<br>\n<br>These Terms and Conditions shall be governed and interpreted in accordance with the applicable laws of the jurisdiction in which the website operator is established, without regard to conflict of law principles.\n<br>\n<br>15. Contact Us\n<br>\n<br>If you have any questions regarding these Terms and Conditions, please contact us:\n<br>\n<br>Email: support@audifort.com<br></p>\n            </div>\n        </div>\n    </div>\n</section>",
